> I'm trying to get a Slash'EM wizard to survive at least until the Quest.
> She's chaotic, and human. Should she get an early wish, what should she wish for?

If you have a ring of polymorph control, you might consider a wand of
polymorph.

You can use it on yourself and your spellbooks.

If you have a leash/magic whistle/blessed leaf, you might consider a
blessed figurine of a Solar.  Don't let it kill all the
shopkeepers/priests, though.  Shopkeeper services are very helpful in
Slashem.

If you are powerful enough to cast it, a blessed spellbook of charm
monster is very useful.  If your luck is high, you can also wish for a
magic marker and write it yourself, along with other powerful spells.



